---
// 터미널 스타일 홈. claude.ai/design "Pulppixel LazyGit" 안을 바닐라로 포팅(src/scripts/terminal/).
// 풀스크린 자기완결형이라 BaseLayout 미사용 (explore.astro 와 동일 패턴).
const title = 'pulppixel — 백환기(Hwankee Baik) · Software Engineer';
const description = '백환기(Hwankee Baik) · Software Engineer. 게임 클라이언트를 중심으로 모바일·웹·실시간 네트워크까지 다루며, 1인 스튜디오 동글랩(Dongle Lab)을 운영합니다. 프로젝트 기록과 3D 월드, 미니게임을 담은 터미널 스타일 포트폴리오.';
const og = 'https://pulppixel.github.io/og.png';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <meta name="author" content="Hwankee Baik" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://pulppixel.github.io/" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://pulppixel.github.io/" />
  <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
  <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
  <meta property="og:image" content={og} />
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="ko_KR" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Pulppixel" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content={og} />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nanum+Gothic+Coding:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/cascadia-code/400.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/cascadia-code/700.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style is:global>
    /* 터미널 DOM 은 JS(innerHTML) 로 주입되므로 스코프드 스타일이 닿지 않는다 — 전역으로 선언 */
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { background: #13111c; height: 100%; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    ::selection { background: #c4a7e7; color: #191724; }
    @keyframes blink { 0%, 49.9% { opacity: 1; } 50%, 100% { opacity: 0; } }
    @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    @keyframes pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.985); } to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }
    .cur::after { content: "\2585"; color: #c4a7e7; animation: blink 1.05s infinite; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 9px; height: 9px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #403d52; border-radius: 6px; border: 2px solid transparent; background-clip: padding-box; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #524f67; background-clip: padding-box; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
    #app {
      --pad: clamp(0px, 4vw, 52px);
      height: 100vh; height: 100dvh; width: 100%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: max(var(--pad), env(safe-area-inset-top)) max(var(--pad), env(safe-area-inset-right)) max(var(--pad), env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) max(var(--pad), env(safe-area-inset-left));
      font-family: 'CaskaydiaCove Nerd Font', 'Cascadia Code', 'D2Coding', 'Nanum Gothic Coding', 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      background:
        radial-gradient(60% 50% at 80% 8%, rgba(196,167,231,.32) 0%, rgba(196,167,231,0) 60%),
        radial-gradient(55% 48% at 14% 90%, rgba(122,162,247,.20) 0%, rgba(122,162,247,0) 58%),
        radial-gradient(46% 42% at 92% 95%, rgba(235,188,186,.13) 0%, rgba(235,188,186,0) 62%),
        linear-gradient(150deg, #241d3a 0%, #1a1626 46%, #100e18 100%);
    }
    /* no-JS 폴백 */
    .noscript-fallback { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px; color: #cdc9de; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; line-height: 1.8; }
    .noscript-fallback h1 { color: #e0def4; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .noscript-fallback a { color: #9ccfd8; }
    .noscript-fallback .muted { color: #6e6a86; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div id="app"></div>

  <noscript>
    <div class="noscript-fallback">
      <h1>백환기 / Hwankee Baik</h1>
      <p class="muted">Software Engineer · 1인 스튜디오 Dongle Lab</p>
      <p>게임 클라이언트를 중심으로 모바일·웹·실시간 네트워크까지 폭넓게 다룹니다. 신생아 작명 서비스 이음작명소와 WebAR 갤러리 플랫폼 PEEKAR를 직접 만들어 운영합니다.</p>
      <p>
        <a href="/projects/eterna/">ETERNA</a> ·
        <a href="/projects/reiw/">REIW</a> · <a href="/projects/stelsi-wallet/">STELSI Wallet</a> ·
        <a href="/explore/">3D 월드</a>
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        <a href="mailto:devenvy100@gmail.com">Email</a> ·
        <a href="https://github.com/pulppixel">GitHub</a> ·
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hwankee-baik-272948266/">LinkedIn</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </noscript>

  <script>
    import { Terminal } from '../scripts/terminal/terminal';
    const app = document.getElementById('app');
    if (app) new Terminal(app).mount();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
